**Issue**: #151
Feature: Remove the automated SDLC loop and unattended mode
  The 3.0 plugin uses explicit OMP and Herdr workflows without the retired runner.

  Scenario: Fresh install has no automated loop surface
    Given nmg-sdlc 3.0 is installed as an OMP extension
    When fresh install has no automated loop surface is inspected
    Then only the explicit native-plan and Herdr OMP workflow remains observable

